        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: This game does NOT use any models from any other site. This game includes original models made by me and SXP.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, alright, let me break it down for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a new job, a pristine new mall, and a terrifying new reality. You just landed the job of a night shift security guard at an overhyped and pretty garbage mall that's about to open in a week from now. Think it'll be easy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nope. It won't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got a guy in a black jacket + blue shirt fit named Nate on his way to your office to kill you, and <strong>you can't run, you can only hide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here are some tools you can use to survive! <strong>(and by you can use, I mean YOU HAVE TO USE)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 Camera feed that malfunctions every now and then</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 Closet with limited oxygen; Plan carefully!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ Some pretty good looking visuals.. right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤡 and your annoying boss who calls you every night just to piss you off.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really, not more than that. Let's make something clear though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got<strong> five</strong> nights,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>one</strong> job,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and<strong> ZERO</strong> backup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Night Shift at Nate's, the horror game that 100% deserves to be on your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the shift, survive the night. Do you think you got what it takes?</p>",
